{"content":[{"c":["SHAARAIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of 14 cities in the lowland region of the territory allotted to Judah’s tribe for an inheritance, listed between Azekah and Adithaim (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.36","r":"Josh.15.36","rawR":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.36","value":"Josh.15.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:36"},"). Shaaraim was in the direction in which the Philistines tried to escape from the pursuing Israelites following David’s slaying of Goliath (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.17.52","r":"1Sam.17.52","rawR":"1Sam.17.52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.17.52","value":"1Sam.17.52"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 17:52"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of 14 cities where the sons of Shimei, a descendant of Simeon, lived until David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.31","r":"1Chr.4.31","rawR":"1Chr.4.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.31","value":"1Chr.4.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:31"},"). It is possibly the same city as Sharuhen (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.6","r":"Josh.19.6","rawR":"Josh.19.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.6","value":"Josh.19.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:6"},"), mentioned in a parallel passage, and Shilhim, located in the southern portion of Judah near Edom’s border (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.32","r":"Josh.15.32","rawR":"Josh.15.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.32","value":"Josh.15.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:32"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shaaraim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.36","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.36"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 17:52","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.17.52","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.17.52","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.17.52"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.31","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.31","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.31"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.6","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.6","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.6"},{"anchorText":"15:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.32","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.32","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.32"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5e4f3a339bbd5d875d1dbf31f4f61740bcee7257be7b33d500c1761b356dffa4","sourceItemName":"Shaaraim","sourceItemOrder":178,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Shaaraim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Shaaraim","title":"Shaaraim","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}